<title>UK: UK M4 grows final 11.2 pct in year to March.</title>
<headline>UK M4 grows final 11.2 pct in year to March.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England published the following data on UK monetary aggregates for March -</p>
<p>    MONEY SUPPLY			    March  pvs reported* Feb</p>
<p>    M4 in month	  (adjusted)	1.0	 1.0	 1.4</p>
<p>	 in year to date (adjusted)	11.2     11.2	11.2</p>
<p>    M4 in month	  (unadjusted)    2.1	 2.1	 1.6</p>
<p>	 in year to date (unadjusted)    11.1     11.2	11.3</p>
<p>Adjusted lending by banks, building</p>
<p>    societies in billions of stg	  4.9	4.5	 8.2</p>
<p>* Preliminary March data, reported on April 18</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
